The capture emulator builder downloads DOSBox-X from
https://github.com/joncampbell123/dosbox-x.git at revision
478c860050b20afdb58bce28f1b43163952fc541.

DOSBox-X is licensed under GPL version 2 or any later version. The external
source checkout retains the complete upstream COPYING license and all source
copyright notices. The source and executable remain external build artifacts;
the repository does not redistribute DOSBox-X source or binaries.

The authored dosbox_capture_hook.h observer is inserted into the normal CPU
core through an include and one call before instruction decode. The integration
also adds a capture-only clean host exit when the SDL window closes, avoiding
guest DOS cleanup after recording has been flushed. These changes affect only
the external instrumented emulator and leave the original executable intact.
The integration uses DOSBox-X register, memory, and graphics APIs without copying upstream
implementation code. The integrated emulator is subject to DOSBox-X's GPL
terms if redistributed. This separate tool integration does not select a
license for the Rust recreation or the project's other authored source.

No original game instructions, graphics, input files, or captured data are
included in the observer. Its startup fingerprint is provided externally by
configuration for the selected original executable.
